  "title": "Week 14: I am reusing LinkedIn",
  "date": "2025-04-03T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 14: I am reusing LinkedIn\n\nI am reusing LinkedIn. It is been a year that people are telling me how important LinkedIn is. I just think it is quite old to use that platform. After last week, I tried to read the feeds. I don't know, maybe because I am noe looking for a platform to replace Twitter, I found it quite interesting. You can't see so many political posts, the feeds are majorly focused on career and technology which are what I really care about. So, in conclusion, I am going back to linkedIn.\n\nAnyway, next week, I will also pick up some language study as I always decided.\n\nMy LinkedIn profile: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jian-gong-27762aa8/",
